meters": ["The slime girl begins to engulf you as your"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["vision fades to black."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[255, 255, 255, 255], 120, true]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [4, 8, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-1", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No!\\. Dammit get off him! He's going to "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["drown inside you!"]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 230, "parameters": [30]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-1", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...I'm sorry \\n[1]."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [4, 18, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Alaru Faceset", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Back you beast! Don't you touch him!\\. "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Damn, I can't pull him out!"]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 230, "parameters": [30]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Alaru Faceset", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...I'm sorry \\n[1], I tried.\\. I swear."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlueSlime7", 0, 0, 70, 0, 40, 40, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Your vision starts to return and the first thing you "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["see is the slime bouncing away on top of you. As you"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["orgasm for what probably isn't the last or first "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["time that day you fall back into unconsciousness."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["After a while your mind starts to fill will strange"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["desires and a burning hunger begins to set in.\\."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["                A hunger for fluid."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlueSlime11", 0, 0, 46, 0, 42, 42, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The next time you wake up, you're presented with "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["a different scene; your entire body has changed, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["and your mind is empty. Nothing but that same "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["hunger remains."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [20]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlueSlime12", 0, 0, 55, 0, 50, 50, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["With your new sister in tow, you head out of the"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["cave.\\. Both of you in a single mindset, to find"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["and consume anything liquid."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[-255, -255, -255, 255], 1, false]},